    "limits": "Runtime proofs are not retained as files and are described in the plan: a two-cell S5 matrix on two builds of one snapshot (no-regression pass, work gain fail), a full native code-block run (validity pass, native budgets missed), eight functional spec tests on a production build, a strict schema-construction failure over an old passing artifact, and real CLI reruns of collab-readiness (current) and core-node-transforms (producer broken, stale). Most lab artifacts stay unknown until their targets rerun; producers that record no inputs stay unknown after a rerun; threshold rows stay unassessed until producers record operators. No performance acceptance, all-target rerun or calibration is claimed. The global ledger check is red on the tooling/distribution inventory group, which mixes this plan's tooling/scripts edits with other sessions' edits."
